{"4349950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Alchemist", "steam_appid": 4349950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4743750], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a medieval adventure filled with magic, potions, and intriguing research.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study alchemy and create various things, whether they are combat skills, devices to help characters, tools to transform the world, or ways to change it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To solve puzzles of different kinds: combat, peaceful, logical, philosophical, and world-based challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features an Aspect system on which the entire world is built. Through this system, you can study the world, modify it as you wish, and solve puzzles either to help characters or to serve your own goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a medieval adventure filled with magic, potions, and intriguing research.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study alchemy and create various things, whether they are combat skills, devices to help characters, tools to transform the world, or ways to change it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To solve puzzles of different kinds: combat, peaceful, logical, philosophical, and world-based challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features an Aspect system on which the entire world is built. Through this system, you can study the world, modify it as you wish, and solve puzzles either to help characters or to serve your own goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A magic-focused action battle* RPG where research and alchemy shape your path through combat encounters, puzzles, and challenges across diverse locations.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Belarusian, Dutch, Indonesian, Thai, Vietnamese, Irish, Armenian, Azerbaijani, Croatian, Estonian, Georgian, Hindi, Icelandic, Latvian, Lithuanian, Luxembourgish, Scots, Serbian, Slovak, Slovenian, Turkmen, Uzbek, Welsh, Gujarati, Kannada, Malayalam, Marathi, Odia, Kazakh", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349950/58486d46d6abe72d54bdfe294effd12271a0f477/header.jpg?t=1787830627", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349950/5be831e1954305bfdd3d15f7e10651ee6491eb66/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787830627", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349950/5be831e1954305bfdd3d15f7e10651ee6491eb66/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787830627", "website": "https://www.youtube.com/@murbenchik", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-9100 or AMD Ryzen 5 2500U<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GT 1030 or AMD Radeon RX 540<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong